# Pomodoro Timer — a 200-tick circular dial dragged horizontally (pan -> rotation,
# withDecay fling, timing back to 0 when dragged positive) sets seconds shown by a
# 5-digit rolling counter; the timer button counts down with setInterval and shows
# a "Timer completed" alert.
# What this test covers: starting with 0 seconds ("Please enter a valid
# number" alert); a slow drag setting ~5s, starting the timer, a drag during
# the run (must be ignored), the completion alert and its OK (reset); a drag
# to the right (positive progress, springs back to 0); a long fling with
# decay so the counter rolls through many digits; grabbing the dial during
# the decay; starting then stopping a timer mid-run; a stop issued during the start delay.
# The timer button is icon-only: tapped at (338,794).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/pomodoro-timer"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 3500
# Zero seconds: validation alert; the button must stay on Start, so the
# next press starts the timer (no toggle back needed).
press 338 794
wait "text" "Please enter a valid number" 4000
press "label=\"OK\""
wait 1500
# ~5 seconds, run to completion while trying to drag.
gesture pan 250 650 -60 0 1500
wait 1000
press 338 794
wait 1000
gesture pan 250 650 -100 0 500
wait "text" "Timer completed" 15000
press "label=\"OK\""
wait 1000
# Drag right (positive): returns to 0.
gesture pan 150 650 120 0 600
wait 1000
# Long fling with decay, then grab mid-decay.
gesture fling left 360 650 250
wait 400
press 200 650
wait 600
gesture fling left 360 650 250
wait 2500
# Bring it back near zero with flings to the right (values clamp at 0).
gesture pan 100 650 250 0 400
wait 300
gesture pan 100 650 250 0 400
wait 1500
# Start and stop mid-run.
gesture pan 250 650 -90 0 1500
wait 800
press 338 794
wait 2500
press 338 794
wait 1000
# Quick start/stop (stop 150ms after start, during the 300ms pre-delay).
gesture pan 250 650 -50 0 1200
wait 800
press 338 794
wait 150
press 338 794
wait 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 8000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
